ing of renovation trades, tools, and safety standards is required, along with general knowledge of other trades. The ideal can... View Details Bookmark Facilities Maintenance Technician- Advanced 44 - Facilities Division 445030 - Building Maintenance & Operations SHRA No Are you an experienced maintenance professional with advanced technical expertise in building systems and operations? We are seeking a skilled Advanced Facilities Maintenance Technician to join our Building Maintenance & Operations team. In this role, you will be responsible for maintaining, troubleshooting, repairing, and optimizing HVAC, electrical, plumbing, boiler, and building automati... View Details Bookmark Student Success Navigators  for Elevate (IPSE) 13 - College of Education 131103 - IPSE Temporary No Note: This position is open only to currently enrolled NC State students who are in good academic standing.Primary purpose of this position:NC State’s inclusive postsecondary education program for students with intellectual and developmental disabilities, Elevate is seeking a motivated and reliable Student Success Navigator to support in study halls, courses to promote self-determined learning ... View Details Bookmark Director of Philanthropic Strategy & Prospect Management 14 - College of Engineering 143801 - Engineering Advancement EPS/SAAO No The Director of Philanthropic Strategy & Prospect Management serves as the College of Engineering’s strategic advisor on fundraising performance, portfolio optimization, campaign readiness, and prospect strategy. This position partners closely with the Assistant Dean for Philanthropy and frontline fundraisers to maximize philanthropic results through data-informed decision making, fundraisi... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director, Facilities HR Programs 44 - Facilities Division 447020 - Facilities Human Resources EPS/SAAO No The Assistant Director of Facilities Human Resources (FHR) serves as a key member of the Facilities Human Resources leadership team and provides strategic direction, oversight, and continuous improvement for a comprehensive portfolio of HR programs that support the employee lifecycle across the Facilities Division. Reporting directly to the Director of Facilities Human Resources, this position ... View Details Bookmark Postdoctoral Research Scholar 14 - College of Engineering 147501 - Lampe Joint Department of BME Post Doc No The Atcha Lab based at NC State is seeking a highly motivated postdoctoral scholar to investigate how mechanical and biochemical cues regulate cell-cell interactions during cardiovascular disease.The lab combines mechanobiology, biomaterials, and molecular biology to uncover mechanisms of cardiac disease and identify new therapeutic targets. View Details Bookmark Facilities Maintenance Technician 44 - Facilities Division 445030 - Building Maintenance & Operations SHRA No Join NC State University’s Building Maintenance and Operations (BMO) team as a Facilities Maintenance Technician – Contributing and build your skills while helping keep our campus facilities safe, reliable, and operating at their best. This hands-on position works within a zone maintenance shop on NC State’s Original Campus, Centennial Campus, or Centennial Biomedical Campus (Veterinary School)... View Details Bookmark Temporary Research Technician 11 - College of Agriculture & Life Sciences (CALS) 111801 - Entomology and Plant Pathology Temporary No Duties include:Processing large numbers of arthropod samples under the stereoscope.Identifying and recording numbers of major insect and mite pests of small fruit crops.Labeling and organizing arthropod samples.Assisting with greenhouse and field collection of arthropod samples.Experience using a stereoscope is preferred.Experience with arthropod identification is preferred but is not required;... View Details Bookmark Facilities Maintenance Technician - Contributing 44 - Facilities Division 445030 - Building Maintenance & Operations SHRA No ​Join NC State University’s Building Maintenance and Operations (BMO) team as a Facilities Maintenance Technician – Contributing and build your skills while helping keep our campus facilities safe, reliable, and operating at their best. This hands-on position works within a zone maintenance shop on NC State’s Original Campus, Centennial Campus, or Centennial Biomedical Campus (Veterinary School... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 … 13 14 Next NC STATE UNIVERSITY RALEIGH, NC 27695 PHONE: (919) 515-2011 Privacy Accessibility Emergency Information Policies NC State Home © 2019 NC State University. All rights reserved To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
