ersity Temporary Services at NC State University and UNC Chapel Hill is currently seeking qualified professionals for a variety of different roles at each campus including: Administrative, HR, Accounting, Program Management, Executive-level support, etc.Recruitments with UTS tend to change on a daily basis and we are unable to post every opportunity we receive therefore, this application se... View Details Bookmark Maintenance Mechanic 24 - Division of Academic and Student Affairs 242290 - Housing Facilities Administration SHRA No The primary purpose of this position is to perform plumbing, HVAC, carpentry, electrical, and household appliance repair and preventative maintenance services so that the residence halls are kept in good repair and meet all local, state, and federal regulations for safe and habitable housing.The Maintenance Mechanic will complete assigned work orders and process information through the use of a... View Details Bookmark Electronics Specialist 44 - Facilities Division 445050 - Utilities and Engineering SHRA No Join NC State Facilities as an Electronics Specialist and play a critical role in supporting the systems that keep our campus running. This position provides advanced technical expertise in the maintenance, troubleshooting, calibration, and repair of sophisticated electronic and digital control systems within our thermal plant operations.As an Electronics Specialist, you will work with the tech... View Details Bookmark Senior Facilities Maintenance Engineer 44 - Facilities Division 445030 - Building Maintenance & Operations Exempt Professional Staff No Join our Facilities team as a Senior Facilities Maintenance Engineer, where you will play a critical role in shaping the performance, reliability, and sustainability of campus building systems. This position provides high-level engineering expertise supporting the design, construction, and ongoing operations of complex facilities infrastructure.In this role, you will apply advanced engineering ... View Details Bookmark Electrician II 44 - Facilities Division 445030 - Building Maintenance & Operations SHRA No Are you an experienced electrician who enjoys solving complex technical challenges and making a meaningful impact on campus operations? Join our Building Maintenance and Operations team as an Electrician II, where you’ll play a vital role in ensuring the reliability, safety, and efficiency of our campus electrical and mechanical systems.This position offers the opportunity to work on a wide ran... View Details Bookmark Temporary Horticultural Camp Counselor 11 - College of Agriculture & Life Sciences (CALS) 111501 - Horticultural Science Temporary No The Horticultural Science Summer Institute Counselors are the primary caregivers for the program campers. The Counselor is responsible for supervising and guiding campers in their personal growth and daily living skills. Assist in the direction, supervision, and organization of campers in their dorms, within activities and throughout the camp in order to meet the intended camper outcomes.Apply ... View Details Bookmark Anatomic Pathology Resident 19 - College of Veterinary Medicine (CVM) 196001 - Department of Population Health and Pathobiology Post Doc No The College of Veterinary Medicine at North Carolina State University (NC State) invites outstanding candidates to apply for three open 3-year residency positions in veterinary anatomic pathology beginning July 2027. The training program focuses on hands-on learning of anatomic pathology and ACVP board preparation under the supervision of eight ACVP board-certified anatomic pathologists, with s... View Details Bookmark Postdoctoral Research Scholar - Oncology 19 - College of Veterinary Medicine (CVM) 195001 - Department of Clinical Sciences Post Doc No The Postdoctoral Research Scholar will work under the direct guidance of Dr. Mike Nolan, a veterinary radiation oncologist whose research includes both comparative oncology and cancer neurosciences